<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-004" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death" source-id="s-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death-ws1767523">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">隆昌元年春正月丁未，改元，大赦。加太傅竟陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death:p001:m0022" ref="x3q_cqm_dup">子良</persName>殊禮。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月辛巳，衞將軍、開府儀同三司<rs id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death:p002:m0016" type="unresolved">武陵王曄</rs>薨。戊子，太傅竟陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-004-ziliang-death:p002:m0030" ref="x3q_cqm_dup">子良</persName>薨。</p>
</text>
